      "type": "text",
      "id": "cp",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 440,
      "text": "Eleven steps, but only five waves. The longest chain through the graph is what a run actually costs - everything\noff that chain is free, because it was already running alongside something slower.",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "originalText": "Eleven steps, but only five waves. The longest chain through the graph is what a run actually costs - everything\noff that chain is free, because it was already running alongside something slower.",
      "width": 873.6,
      "height": 32.5
    },
